WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 39=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:41.680 --> 01:42.920
Didn't you want to know

01:44.680 --> 01:45.680
how our ways

01:46.519 --> 01:47.560
differ?

02:09.000 --> 02:23.479
♪These shackles weigh like a mountain♪

02:23.680 --> 02:29.960
♪They break my very spine♪

02:30.000 --> 02:30.800
This is

02:30.879 --> 02:32.000
the great Tang general

02:32.439 --> 02:33.319
Gao Xianzhi?

02:35.280 --> 02:36.080
That's right.

02:37.759 --> 02:40.639
General Gao was much like you,
Young Master.

02:41.759 --> 02:43.159
He, too, came from a noble family,

02:43.439 --> 02:44.919
was well-read from childhood,

02:45.240 --> 02:46.560
and was a fearless warrior.

02:47.080 --> 02:49.319
He was made a general in his twenties.

02:50.159 --> 02:51.439
The eunuch Bian Lingcheng

02:51.719 --> 02:54.240
was sent by Emperor Xuanzong
to oversee the army.

02:55.000 --> 02:57.719
A coward who'd forsake honor for profit.

02:58.280 --> 03:01.000
Gao Xianzhi defied Bian Lingcheng's
repeated attempts to stop him

03:01.360 --> 03:04.639
and led his men across the glaciers
at the risk of his life,

03:04.840 --> 03:06.719
conquering Lesser Bolv in one strike

03:07.000 --> 03:08.439
and capturing its king alive.

03:09.479 --> 03:10.280
After that battle,

03:10.648 --> 03:12.190
the Tang's renown grew even greater.

03:12.759 --> 03:14.759
From Anyuan Gate west to the border,

03:15.120 --> 03:16.599
stretching 6,000 km,

03:16.808 --> 03:19.830
villages lay in sight of one another,
and mulberry and hemp covered the land.

03:20.000 --> 03:21.479
Of all the rich lands under heaven,

03:21.719 --> 03:22.800
none could match Longyou.

03:22.800 --> 03:24.280
♪His Majesty declares♪

03:24.439 --> 03:27.919
♪Merit that eclipses the throne
is a crime in itself♪

03:28.039 --> 03:29.919
♪The general's star shines too bright♪

03:29.919 --> 03:32.400
Though Gao Xianzhi won the battle

03:32.560 --> 03:33.719
and was made a duke,

03:34.879 --> 03:36.080
he incurred Bian Lingcheng's

03:36.520 --> 03:37.520
bitter resentment.

03:38.719 --> 03:40.400
♪Let me cleanse♪

03:40.400 --> 03:43.199
♪Your disloyal soul♪

03:46.599 --> 03:53.240
♪His loyalty served a den of jackals♪

03:53.319 --> 04:02.439
♪His blood spilled in vain
at a feast of flatterers♪

04:04.080 --> 04:05.039
♪Execute him♪

04:39.079 --> 04:45.240
♪Let me send the general off myself♪

05:24.199 --> 05:27.879
♪If Taizong asks me in the underworld♪

05:28.079 --> 05:32.680
♪Let the cuckoo carry my wronged soul♪

05:32.680 --> 05:36.279
♪See Xingqing Palace's peonies wither♪

05:36.279 --> 05:41.319
♪While Huaqing Pool gleams with rouge♪

05:44.439 --> 05:49.319
♪Behold, the moon above
the armored general's grave♪

05:49.319 --> 05:50.959
♪Shining down upon♪

05:50.959 --> 05:55.800
♪The swirling Rainbow Feather Dance♪

06:17.399 --> 06:18.480
His Majesty

06:19.199 --> 06:20.360
is a wise ruler.

06:24.040 --> 06:25.560
And I am utterly loyal.

06:30.959 --> 06:32.600
In the golden age of Kaiyuan,

06:33.600 --> 06:35.040
Gao Xianzhi also firmly believed

06:35.800 --> 06:37.439
Emperor Xuanzong was a wise ruler.

06:41.319 --> 06:42.839
The wind is born from the earth

06:43.519 --> 06:45.319
and stirs at the tips of the duckweed.

06:46.959 --> 06:49.519
Even I, an outsider to the court,
can see it.

06:52.760 --> 06:54.360
Yet you turn a blind eye, Young Master.

06:56.600 --> 06:58.120
You just don't want to see it.

07:11.839 --> 07:13.240
This is my way.

07:18.984 --> 07:21.290
I don't accept that subjects
must submit to their rulers,

07:21.839 --> 07:24.240
sons to fathers, and wives to husbands.

07:25.240 --> 07:27.959
Why must a subject die
just because his ruler says so?

07:29.240 --> 07:31.079
They say murder must be paid in blood.

07:32.040 --> 07:33.199
Yet in this world,

07:33.759 --> 07:34.959
the one who kills the most,

07:35.480 --> 07:36.879
by the cruelest means,

07:38.160 --> 07:39.399
is the Son of Heaven.

07:41.240 --> 07:42.399
Wiping out entire families,

07:45.160 --> 07:46.399
executing ten degrees of kin,

07:46.488 --> 07:48.390
cutting men in half,
and slicing them apart...

07:50.480 --> 07:52.439
Aren't these all the Emperor's doing?

08:04.560 --> 08:05.360
I know

08:06.360 --> 08:08.399
you've also defied convention at times.

08:10.000 --> 08:12.199
You dared to cane your father
for your mother's sake.

08:12.504 --> 08:14.750
You dared to secretly bury
Grand Secretary Shen's family.

08:15.279 --> 08:16.639
You even dared to secretly free...

08:20.079 --> 08:20.879
But

08:22.079 --> 08:23.160
in the end, you

08:24.439 --> 08:26.160
are still the Lin family's Young Master.

08:28.360 --> 08:30.399
You must devote yourself to the throne

08:31.480 --> 08:33.080
to glorify your forebears and heirs,

08:33.816 --> 08:35.390
and win honors for your wife and sons.

08:46.159 --> 08:46.879
I know

08:48.000 --> 08:49.440
what I've said today

08:49.720 --> 08:50.960
is shocking.

08:52.039 --> 08:53.440
If you can't accept it,

08:54.360 --> 08:56.200
you can pretend it never happened.

09:09.480 --> 09:13.000
Sunlight bright, and moonlight bright.

09:13.360 --> 09:16.480
Up at dawn to study hard,

09:17.200 --> 09:18.679
pricking the thigh to stay awake,

09:18.919 --> 09:20.480
hair tied to a beam to stay up,

09:20.616 --> 09:22.440
reading by a neighbor's borrowed light.

09:22.559 --> 09:25.720
One day, first in the imperial exam,

09:26.120 --> 09:29.320
a high official seated in court.

09:30.279 --> 09:33.639
Sunlight bright, and moonlight bright.

09:33.799 --> 09:37.120
Up at dawn to train hard,

09:37.519 --> 09:38.840
sword in hand at first light,

09:39.279 --> 09:40.840
through winter cold and summer heat,

09:41.120 --> 09:42.559
never once going home.

09:43.039 --> 09:46.440
Then off to glory on a white horse,

09:46.840 --> 09:50.120
bringing home gold and jade.

09:50.120 --> 09:51.460
(Deep Roots, Lasting Grace)

09:52.780 --> 09:57.820
(Three Months Later)

09:58.180 --> 10:00.759
(Lin Zhangrui,
son of Lin Jinlan and Tan Suhua)

10:00.759 --> 10:01.559
Who's this?

10:02.039 --> 10:02.879
Call me big sister.

10:02.879 --> 10:04.759
I will give you candy, okay?

10:05.200 --> 10:07.039
Call me Auntie.

10:08.840 --> 10:10.639
Auntie will buy you toys.

10:12.159 --> 10:13.360
Call me big sister.

10:13.440 --> 10:15.960
Our little one is so sturdy.

10:16.440 --> 10:18.120
You'll grow up just like Uncle Jinqi,

10:18.120 --> 10:19.039
strong and healthy,

10:19.039 --> 10:20.200
and become a great general.

10:20.399 --> 10:21.200
Right?

10:25.679 --> 10:27.639
This child is so hardy.

10:27.639 --> 10:29.559
Eats well and sleeps well all day.

10:29.559 --> 10:30.320
Don't you?

10:33.448 --> 10:34.270
Have you and Jinlan

10:34.279 --> 10:36.240
decided on his hundred-day celebration?

10:36.519 --> 10:38.840
Jinlan says with the elders away,

10:38.840 --> 10:40.260
there's no need for a grand affair.

10:40.440 --> 10:41.960
Just a family gathering will do.

10:47.600 --> 10:48.879
In his letter, the Old Master

10:49.600 --> 10:50.799
asked about the child.

10:51.679 --> 10:52.960
With the child this big,

10:53.360 --> 10:55.039
I can't hide it any longer.

10:55.320 --> 10:56.600
I had to tell him the truth.

10:57.960 --> 10:59.320
I'd guess that once spring comes,

10:59.399 --> 11:01.159
Concubine Zhou will rush to the capital.

11:01.639 --> 11:03.960
The Master may even come, too.

11:04.360 --> 11:05.639
I've already stolen from Heaven

11:05.879 --> 11:07.039
two whole years of freedom.

11:07.919 --> 11:08.799
I'm content.

11:10.440 --> 11:12.039
I'm only sorry that for my sake, Jinqi,

11:12.296 --> 11:13.840
you'll be scolded by the Master again.

11:14.919 --> 11:16.720
The Master has never liked me anyway.

11:17.159 --> 11:18.639
In one ear and out the other.

11:18.960 --> 11:19.879
I'll just ignore him.

11:30.240 --> 11:31.240
This winter,

11:31.270 --> 11:32.790
you seem unusually sensitive to cold.

11:33.039 --> 11:34.120
Tell me the truth.

11:34.720 --> 11:36.000
How is your health, really?

11:40.639 --> 11:41.399
I'm fine.

11:48.320 --> 11:48.840
Jinlan.

11:49.559 --> 11:50.200
Jinlan!

11:52.159 --> 11:52.720
Jinlan!

11:55.384 --> 11:56.904
Jinlan's heart condition is acting up!

11:56.936 --> 11:57.840
Get a physician, quick!

12:05.519 --> 12:05.960
Jinlan.

12:09.000 --> 12:09.519
Medicine...

12:19.128 --> 12:20.080
Jinlan.

12:25.672 --> 12:26.510
Jinlan.

12:27.080 --> 12:28.559
Jinlan can't breathe.

12:28.919 --> 12:29.759
Everyone, stay back.

12:30.519 --> 12:31.480
Open the window a crack.

12:32.480 --> 12:33.120
Come back.

12:44.824 --> 12:45.630
Second Young Master.

12:52.960 --> 12:53.759
I'm here.

12:55.320 --> 12:56.080
Jinlan...

13:08.639 --> 13:09.399
I'm sorry.

13:15.519 --> 13:15.960
Jinlan,

13:16.559 --> 13:17.799
don't talk, okay?

13:19.480 --> 13:20.639
Hold on a little longer.

13:21.759 --> 13:23.200
The physician will be here soon.

13:47.840 --> 13:48.480
No tears.

13:53.112 --> 13:54.080
I won't cry anymore.

13:57.360 --> 13:58.360
I promised you

14:01.039 --> 14:01.840
I'd be strong

14:04.240 --> 14:05.080
and not cry.

14:23.240 --> 14:24.320
Here's the baby.

14:30.200 --> 14:30.799
Jinlan.

14:32.120 --> 14:33.480
For Suhua and the baby,

14:33.559 --> 14:34.840
hold on a little longer.

14:34.960 --> 14:36.080
The physician is on his way.

14:45.600 --> 14:46.240
All right.

14:47.559 --> 14:48.399
I promise you.

14:49.759 --> 14:51.000
I'll take good care of the child

14:52.679 --> 14:53.840
and raise him well.

15:04.600 --> 15:05.600
Jinlan says

15:07.320 --> 15:09.519
he'll be your brother again
in the next life,

15:11.559 --> 15:12.600
and repay your kindness.

15:34.000 --> 15:35.120
Here's the baby.

15:57.039 --> 15:58.039
Don't worry.

15:59.279 --> 16:01.320
Suhua is like my own sister.

16:03.159 --> 16:04.840
As long as I'm in the Lin Residence,

16:07.120 --> 16:08.720
I'll never let her be wronged.

16:16.020 --> 16:22.620
♪Every word carries countless thoughts♪

16:23.700 --> 16:25.980
♪The encounters of half a lifetime♪

16:26.980 --> 16:30.700
♪Are kept within this little world♪

16:30.780 --> 16:37.660
♪Bit by bit, the passing years
become the preface♪

16:40.559 --> 16:41.039
Suhua.

16:42.472 --> 16:43.200
Enjoy your meal.

16:46.540 --> 16:51.060
♪With my own hands and heart♪

16:51.060 --> 16:54.260
♪I write my name♪

16:54.940 --> 16:58.300
♪Through countless lines of ink♪

16:58.300 --> 17:01.540
♪Step by step toward the light♪

17:04.400 --> 17:05.200
Jinlan...

17:06.160 --> 17:06.960
Jinlan...

17:06.960 --> 17:09.380
♪I'll rewrite my fate♪

17:09.380 --> 17:11.660
♪The long night is almost over♪

17:11.660 --> 17:20.100
♪I won't dwell on the past anymore♪

17:30.900 --> 17:37.660
♪Every word carries countless thoughts♪

17:38.340 --> 17:41.220
♪The encounters of half a lifetime♪

17:41.940 --> 17:45.980
♪Are kept within this little world♪

17:45.980 --> 17:52.660
♪Bit by bit, the passing years
become the preface♪

17:53.960 --> 17:55.079
Jinlan.

17:57.550 --> 17:59.992
Guan Zhong did not die. Du Huo.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "to live alone."]

18:00.039 --> 18:01.160
Good.

18:01.160 --> 18:02.319
Well done, Jinlan!

18:04.264 --> 18:05.890
Thank you, Grandfather, for allowing it.

18:07.440 --> 18:08.079
Don't panic.

18:08.312 --> 18:10.440
The more urgent things get,
the calmer you must stay.

18:11.960 --> 18:14.319
Thank you and Lanxiang,
for taking care of everything.

18:14.319 --> 18:16.940
♪Step by step toward the light♪

18:16.940 --> 18:21.060
♪With what I know and what I do♪

18:21.060 --> 18:24.340
♪I'll rewrite my fate♪

18:24.340 --> 18:26.380
♪The long night is almost over♪

18:26.700 --> 18:34.820
♪I won't dwell on the past anymore♪

19:11.480 --> 19:12.400
Suhua, take a look.

19:13.160 --> 19:14.359
Is this all right?

19:20.839 --> 19:21.759
It's very well done.

19:29.900 --> 19:33.220
(Lin Zhangrui, Nine Months Old)

19:36.240 --> 19:37.119
Second Young Lady!

19:37.400 --> 19:38.200
Second Young Lady!

19:38.360 --> 19:39.200
Second Young Madam!

19:39.440 --> 19:40.920
Go to the front, quickly!

19:41.096 --> 19:43.340
A messenger has come from Jinling
with news of a death.

19:43.680 --> 19:44.519
Old Madam

19:45.240 --> 19:46.200
has passed away.

19:55.039 --> 19:56.279
In the last letter,

19:57.480 --> 20:00.240
Mother said Grandmother was much better

20:00.720 --> 20:02.400
and her speech had become clearer.

20:04.559 --> 20:06.359
How could she suddenly be gone?

20:10.440 --> 20:12.000
I've been so unfilial.

20:13.039 --> 20:15.200
I'd already separated and returned home,

20:16.640 --> 20:19.200
yet I didn't go back to Jinling
to care for Grandmother.

20:22.480 --> 20:24.119
Old Madam lived a long life.

20:24.960 --> 20:26.319
Xiulai, Xiuwan,

20:26.840 --> 20:28.240
don't blame yourselves too much.

20:32.519 --> 20:34.000
Why won't the Old Master

20:34.000 --> 20:35.240
let us go home for the funeral?

20:36.880 --> 20:39.000
To save on military expenses,

20:39.000 --> 20:40.488
His Majesty is slashing troop numbers.

20:40.960 --> 20:43.160
Too many men, and too few posts.

20:43.440 --> 20:45.000
Many hold official titles

20:45.720 --> 20:47.000
but have no real duties.

20:51.359 --> 20:53.519
If Jinqi returns to Jinling to mourn,

20:54.200 --> 20:55.400
the round trip

20:55.816 --> 20:57.440
would take two or three months at least.

20:58.904 --> 21:00.440
The Old Master fears that Jinqi's post

21:00.440 --> 21:01.770
would be filled by someone else.

21:02.160 --> 21:03.000
The Old Master

21:03.480 --> 21:04.799
is just taking precautions.

21:07.440 --> 21:08.920
But I miss Mother

21:09.319 --> 21:11.039
and my brothers.

21:12.039 --> 21:13.960
I want to go back to Jinling.

21:16.160 --> 21:17.559
When the Second Young Master died,

21:18.680 --> 21:19.880
it was bitterly cold.

21:20.680 --> 21:22.039
With a frail mother and a baby,

21:22.160 --> 21:23.559
we couldn't take his coffin home.

21:24.799 --> 21:26.720
If Xiuwan wants to go back to Jinling,

21:27.960 --> 21:28.880
Zhangrui and I

21:28.880 --> 21:30.880
will take his coffin back with us

21:33.680 --> 21:35.160
and lay him to rest.

21:41.640 --> 21:43.079
This is no small matter.

21:44.000 --> 21:45.799
We should let the Young Master decide.

21:49.000 --> 21:50.559
From the capital to Jinling

21:51.000 --> 21:52.079
is a long way.

21:52.640 --> 21:55.359
Zhangrui is young and frail,

21:55.960 --> 21:58.079
at an age when he falls ill easily.

21:59.839 --> 22:00.920
On the way,

22:01.400 --> 22:03.400
if he doesn't adapt to new surroundings

22:03.640 --> 22:04.759
or comes down with a fever,

22:06.039 --> 22:07.720
I couldn't face Jinlan.

22:13.279 --> 22:14.000
How about

22:14.799 --> 22:16.920
I take Suhua and Xiuwan

22:17.079 --> 22:18.039
back myself?

22:23.279 --> 22:24.319
After Jinlan passed,

22:24.839 --> 22:27.279
you requested leave
to bring him back to Jinling.

22:28.039 --> 22:29.599
His Majesty offered kind words

22:29.799 --> 22:31.640
but refused to grant the leave.

22:32.440 --> 22:34.079
Now Suhua and Xiuwan

22:34.319 --> 22:35.559
are desperately homesick.

22:36.359 --> 22:37.559
I could go on your behalf

22:37.680 --> 22:39.119
and take them back with me.

22:58.039 --> 22:59.119
As for returning to Jinling,

23:00.559 --> 23:01.720
let me think it over.

23:07.000 --> 23:09.480
Young Master, do you miss
your family in Jinling?

23:19.880 --> 23:21.440
In less than half a year,

23:23.319 --> 23:25.319
I've lost two of my closest kin.

23:28.200 --> 23:29.400
How could I not miss

23:30.119 --> 23:31.640
everyone back home?

23:37.039 --> 23:38.559
Last year at the theater,

23:40.359 --> 23:42.160
you named so much you don't believe in.

23:43.599 --> 23:45.079
But in this life,

23:47.079 --> 23:48.440
disbelief alone isn't enough.

23:50.720 --> 23:52.519
You have to believe in something

23:53.519 --> 23:55.000
to keep going, don't you?

24:00.599 --> 24:01.519
I believe

24:02.400 --> 24:03.640
the Way of Heaven favors no one.

24:08.079 --> 24:09.240
Isn't that so?

24:11.640 --> 24:13.000
Of all beings in this world,

24:13.240 --> 24:15.440
why are some born rich

24:15.759 --> 24:17.359
and others born poor?

24:18.799 --> 24:21.240
Why do some live long, healthy lives

24:21.920 --> 24:23.640
while others die young and sickly?

24:26.200 --> 24:28.039
Why was Lin Jinqi born

24:28.160 --> 24:30.160
a lofty master,

24:31.400 --> 24:33.440
while Xu Lanxiang was born

24:33.880 --> 24:35.640
a lowly servant?

24:41.640 --> 24:43.160
You have a point.

24:45.279 --> 24:46.480
I'm just surprised

24:47.960 --> 24:49.960
you don't even believe
in the Way of Heaven.

24:51.599 --> 24:52.279
No.

24:53.304 --> 24:54.750
I do believe in the Way of Heaven.

24:59.079 --> 25:00.279
Thank you, Madam.

25:01.039 --> 25:04.519
You and the young lady are good people.
You'll surely be rewarded.

25:05.279 --> 25:06.480
Thank you, Madam.

25:08.960 --> 25:10.920
Give them my spare clothes.

25:15.279 --> 25:17.160
Oh, Heaven!

25:20.119 --> 25:21.039
I believe

25:22.799 --> 25:24.160
the Way of Heaven favors no one,

25:25.160 --> 25:26.440
but always sides with the good.

25:33.880 --> 25:35.680
The Way of Heaven favors no one,

25:36.920 --> 25:38.400
but always sides with the good.

25:43.599 --> 25:45.359
Though this "good" is not that "good,"

25:46.039 --> 25:47.200
compassion

25:47.880 --> 25:49.240
is itself wisdom.

25:50.440 --> 25:51.799
Like the palm and back of a hand,

25:52.456 --> 25:53.680
they're two sides of one whole.

26:06.424 --> 26:08.520
(Evidence of Lin Jinqi's Crimes)
Heaven and Earth are not benevolent.

26:08.880 --> 26:10.759
They treat all things as straw dogs.

26:12.160 --> 26:13.640
The Emperor is not benevolent.

26:14.799 --> 26:16.559
He treats the people as straw dogs.

26:26.279 --> 26:27.640
However clever one may be,

26:29.559 --> 26:31.440
no one can see the future.

26:39.540 --> 26:43.500
(Two Years Later)

26:48.920 --> 26:50.559
Quick, don't let it get away!

26:50.920 --> 26:51.839
Over there!

27:11.519 --> 27:13.079
This is the Eldest Prince's treasure.

27:13.559 --> 27:14.759
Good thing it didn't get away.

27:15.000 --> 27:15.400
Let's go.

27:26.680 --> 27:28.799
This should be Scholar Chen's class now.

27:29.000 --> 27:29.832
(Hai Tao, Fourth-Rank Eunuch)
Those two

27:29.832 --> 27:30.500
(of the Directorate of Ceremonial)
little brats

27:30.519 --> 27:31.960
(Wang Cheng, Fourth-Rank Eunuch)
are skipping class at the Inner School

27:32.279 --> 27:33.240
(of the Directorate of Ceremonial)
to fool around here.

27:33.720 --> 27:34.720
What a disgrace!

27:36.799 --> 27:38.240
Those two young eunuchs

27:38.519 --> 27:40.079
have already become the godsons

27:40.079 --> 27:42.200
of the Prince's head attendant, Wang Yi.

27:42.799 --> 27:45.440
Wang Yi will surely keep them in line.

27:45.880 --> 27:47.440
Why meddle?

27:48.640 --> 27:49.599
The Eldest Prince

27:49.839 --> 27:51.519
favors Wang Yi far too much.

27:53.079 --> 27:54.319
Some officials also say

27:54.559 --> 27:56.079
His Majesty favors us too much,

27:56.279 --> 27:58.559
letting even memorials pass through us.

27:58.759 --> 28:00.200
We are utterly loyal.

28:00.440 --> 28:01.279
How could a flatterer

28:01.279 --> 28:02.960
like Wang Yi compare to us?

28:06.000 --> 28:07.559
Enough. Let's go.

28:08.039 --> 28:11.200
His Majesty is waiting to see
the General Qinglong.

28:14.420 --> 28:31.140
(Eunuchs shall not meddle in politics.)

28:44.860 --> 28:48.839
(Eunuchs shall not meddle in politics.)

28:48.839 --> 28:52.079
Sunlight bright, and moonlight bright.

28:52.519 --> 28:55.519
Ants in the roots bring down the beams.

28:56.319 --> 29:01.519
In silk and jade, they upend all order,

29:01.920 --> 29:04.880
killing the old, killing the young.

29:05.319 --> 29:08.519
A tiger at the door, a wolf out back.

29:15.640 --> 29:19.359
Sunlight bright, and moonlight bright.

29:19.599 --> 29:22.799
Palace walls
are built on piles of bones.

29:23.759 --> 29:29.319
Rise or fall, right or wrong, all folly.

29:29.759 --> 29:33.119
Hailed as a hero of the realm yesterday,

29:33.480 --> 29:37.000
dumped in a mass grave today.

29:55.440 --> 29:59.319
Sunlight bright, and moonlight bright.

29:59.680 --> 30:03.240
Grass grows where grand palaces burned.

30:03.519 --> 30:09.319
Loyal or traitor, all a passing dream.

30:09.640 --> 30:13.079
Wise ministers and famous generals,

30:13.440 --> 30:17.119
nothing left but a crumbling wall.

30:28.400 --> 30:31.559
Tofu! Fresh tofu!

30:31.559 --> 30:32.740
(Taiping)

30:33.400 --> 30:34.400
Tofu!

30:34.960 --> 30:36.440
Fresh tofu!

30:40.240 --> 30:41.319
Tofu!

30:42.440 --> 30:43.799
Fresh tofu!

30:46.480 --> 30:47.759
Two buns, please.

30:47.759 --> 30:48.759
Coming right up.

31:31.500 --> 31:38.460
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

31:57.180 --> 31:59.780
♪Look at us♪

32:00.660 --> 32:04.660
♪We've shared countless
beautiful moments♪

32:05.920 --> 32:09.839
Sunlight bright, and moonlight bright.

32:09.920 --> 32:13.480
Red candles flicker,
and blossoms are sweet.

32:14.400 --> 32:19.799
Hand in hand, we laugh as one,
a pair of mandarin ducks.

32:20.519 --> 32:23.960
Unafraid of the world's wind and frost.

32:24.359 --> 32:27.960
Face to face,
dawn to dusk, love endures.

32:27.960 --> 32:30.580
♪Our bond runs deep♪

32:30.980 --> 32:34.340
♪Binding us closely together♪

32:34.740 --> 32:38.060
♪Washing away the dust
of this mortal world♪

32:38.060 --> 32:42.300
♪Even if we must part in the end♪

32:43.020 --> 32:46.580
♪I'll have no regrets
that we met in this life♪

32:46.580 --> 32:50.500
♪May we stay together until life's end♪

32:50.900 --> 32:54.340
♪Every sincerity you've shown me♪

32:54.340 --> 32:58.060
♪Has long taken root in my heart♪

32:58.060 --> 33:00.900
♪Our bond runs deep♪

33:01.700 --> 33:04.860
♪Binding us closely together♪

33:05.300 --> 33:08.260
♪Washing away the dust
of this mortal world♪

33:08.260 --> 33:12.380
♪Even if we must part in the end♪

33:13.140 --> 33:17.180
♪I'll have no regrets
that we met in this life♪

33:17.180 --> 33:20.980
♪May we stay together until life's end♪

33:21.460 --> 33:24.660
♪Every sincerity you've shown me♪

33:24.660 --> 33:28.540
♪Has long taken root in my heart♪

33:28.540 --> 33:31.540
♪Our bond runs deep♪

33:31.940 --> 33:35.420
♪Binding us closely together♪

33:35.700 --> 33:38.740
♪After all the questions
life has brought♪

33:38.740 --> 33:42.820
♪This love has never faded
in the slightest♪

33:43.860 --> 33:47.580
♪A trace of fragrance lingers on♪

33:47.980 --> 33:51.460
♪How fortunate to find
one person in a lifetime♪

33:51.820 --> 33:53.860
♪Through these warm and gentle years♪

33:53.860 --> 33:59.940
♪My heart remains
as true to you as ever♪

34:19.679 --> 34:22.480
Come and see!

34:22.960 --> 34:26.079
(Taiping)
Lotus in June, lotus root in August!

34:26.360 --> 34:29.679
Fresh and tender, the tastiest!

34:31.039 --> 34:33.920
Come and see!

34:34.000 --> 34:37.280
Lotus in June, lotus root in August!

34:37.400 --> 34:40.039
Fresh and tender, the tastiest!

34:40.039 --> 34:41.360
What fresh lotus root!

34:41.360 --> 34:42.119
Give me some.

35:26.239 --> 35:27.360
You're pregnant now.

35:28.320 --> 35:29.880
Mister Lu is sleeping.

35:30.920 --> 35:32.280
You're expecting now.

35:32.679 --> 35:33.360
Be careful.

35:34.920 --> 35:37.239
I'm healthy. I'm not that delicate.

35:45.000 --> 35:46.000
You're here.

35:46.719 --> 35:47.320
Mother.

35:49.840 --> 35:50.719
This lotus root

35:51.039 --> 35:52.480
looks so fresh.

35:57.440 --> 35:58.800
Come, have a seat.

35:59.000 --> 35:59.480
All right.

36:06.840 --> 36:08.639
Mother, you've mixed them up.

36:09.880 --> 36:13.119
The blue tiger-head shoes and bellyband

36:13.599 --> 36:15.079
are for Zhangrui.

36:16.039 --> 36:18.360
The red ones are for An.

36:19.320 --> 36:20.280
That's right now.

36:20.559 --> 36:21.400
Right.

36:23.800 --> 36:25.360
Whose child is An?

36:25.840 --> 36:27.760
Sister Han's, from next door.

36:27.880 --> 36:29.320
He's the same age as Zhangrui.

36:29.400 --> 36:30.639
Both were born in August,

36:30.920 --> 36:32.639
so Mother got gifts for them both.

36:33.400 --> 36:36.119
After Third Place Scholar Han
became the top provincial graduate,

36:36.119 --> 36:37.760
many came with marriage proposals.

36:38.119 --> 36:39.239
So he decided

36:39.320 --> 36:40.159
to marry his sister

36:40.159 --> 36:42.840
to a classmate from Qixia Academy.

36:43.159 --> 36:43.960
Now,

36:44.239 --> 36:44.840
he's...

36:45.440 --> 36:47.559
he's teaching students to count.

36:49.199 --> 36:50.000
Arithmetic.

36:51.039 --> 36:52.760
The study of doing accounts.

36:53.239 --> 36:53.800
Yes.

36:54.000 --> 36:55.800
They'll surely be good at bookkeeping.

37:04.320 --> 37:04.880
Let me.

37:06.840 --> 37:08.039
Look at you.

37:08.320 --> 37:09.320
Getting old,

37:09.840 --> 37:11.760
a little work and my back aches.

37:13.280 --> 37:13.880
Tomorrow

37:13.880 --> 37:15.679
I'll hire a boy to help at the shop.

37:16.840 --> 37:17.559
No need.

37:17.719 --> 37:19.360
Your father's just acting spoiled

37:19.400 --> 37:20.559
because you're here.

37:21.119 --> 37:22.079
Me? Acting spoiled?

37:26.880 --> 37:29.239
Well, when you just told Lanxiang

37:29.599 --> 37:31.039
that when you do needlework,

37:31.039 --> 37:32.380
your eyes blur and you can't see,

37:32.440 --> 37:33.768
weren't you acting spoiled too?

37:34.159 --> 37:35.800
I'm acting spoiled with my daughter.

37:35.960 --> 37:37.559
My daughter cares about me.

37:37.639 --> 37:38.440
So what?

37:40.960 --> 37:42.079
Fine.

37:42.080 --> 37:43.448
You're getting younger by the day.

37:46.856 --> 37:48.630
(Direct Explanation
of the Laws and Decrees)

37:48.639 --> 37:50.239
Isn't there a set in my study?

37:50.920 --> 37:53.000
Xiushu's dowry gift
is in a few days.

37:53.199 --> 37:54.639
This is my gift for her dowry.

37:57.360 --> 37:58.639
That's quite a gift.

37:59.000 --> 38:00.519
Even if Xiushu has no use for it,

38:00.800 --> 38:01.920
her children can read it.

38:04.000 --> 38:06.199
Are you mocking me, Young Master Lin?

38:07.000 --> 38:07.880
No.

38:08.480 --> 38:09.519
A gift from you

38:09.800 --> 38:11.679
is surely your most treasured one.

38:16.880 --> 38:18.280
Good. Very good.

38:18.400 --> 38:19.199
A fine gift.

38:26.000 --> 38:27.159
Look.

38:27.159 --> 38:28.559
How lovely!

38:29.880 --> 38:32.679
(Lin Xiushu, 19)
I knew Madam Guan painted fine Buddhas,

38:32.800 --> 38:35.000
but thanks to Xiushu,

38:35.039 --> 38:36.840
I finally get to see one.

38:39.440 --> 38:40.320
Thank you, Aunt.

38:41.239 --> 38:43.239
You're welcome. It's only right.

38:43.840 --> 38:45.480
Please, have a seat.

38:46.840 --> 38:48.920
Lovely. Truly lovely.

38:54.079 --> 38:55.639
We elders

38:55.679 --> 38:57.840
bring out our very best.

38:58.039 --> 39:00.119
As for you well-off families,

39:00.440 --> 39:01.719
if what you bring today

39:01.960 --> 39:03.440
isn't your finest treasure,

39:03.519 --> 39:05.519
I'll be the first to object.

39:24.460 --> 39:28.540
(Direct Explanation
of the Laws and Decrees)

39:29.816 --> 39:31.896
A set of Direct Explanation
of the Laws and Decrees

39:32.000 --> 39:33.199
and a rice shop.

39:34.639 --> 39:37.000
May Xiushu have both wealth and wisdom.

39:41.960 --> 39:43.000
Well said.

39:44.039 --> 39:45.280
Thank you, Lanxiang.

39:47.119 --> 39:48.079
My gift...

39:48.599 --> 39:50.119
Jinqiao hasn't brought it yet.

40:01.440 --> 40:02.320
My gift

40:02.679 --> 40:03.800
has quite a story behind it.

40:06.719 --> 40:07.960
What is it?

40:16.159 --> 40:17.239
Xiuwan,

40:17.960 --> 40:19.599
what you've given is...

40:19.960 --> 40:22.000
A golden rod!

40:24.920 --> 40:25.800
As the saying goes,

40:26.159 --> 40:28.599
"A thorny stick makes a filial son."

40:28.800 --> 40:30.719
So I made Xiushu a golden rod.

40:31.719 --> 40:32.800
A golden rod...

40:34.000 --> 40:36.000
If it can make a filial son,

40:36.119 --> 40:37.840
it can make a good husband, too.

40:38.599 --> 40:39.199
Xiushu,

40:39.639 --> 40:41.400
if Third Master Yang ever bullies you,

40:41.400 --> 40:42.920
beat him with the golden rod.

40:44.000 --> 40:45.360
But before you do,

40:45.519 --> 40:46.599
remember to read Lanxiang's

40:46.599 --> 40:48.800
Direct Explanation
of the Laws and Decrees.

40:57.760 --> 40:58.559
Xiuwan,

41:00.079 --> 41:01.519
stop embarrassing me here.

41:04.400 --> 41:05.519
It's thoughtful of her.

41:08.639 --> 41:09.519
Xiushu,

41:09.800 --> 41:10.960
just think of it as

41:10.960 --> 41:12.639
a gold bar from Xiuwan.

41:13.432 --> 41:14.952
That's thoughtful of you, Xiuwan.

41:33.400 --> 41:34.719
This Hundred Children robe

41:35.000 --> 41:36.440
was made by a palace embroiderer,

41:36.440 --> 41:37.480
who spent nine months

41:37.760 --> 41:39.320
stitching it by hand.

41:40.039 --> 41:42.199
Xiushu, may you soon be blessed

41:42.559 --> 41:43.519
with a baby boy.

41:43.639 --> 41:45.079
Thank you, Xiuru.

41:45.239 --> 41:47.480
May you soon have a son, too,

41:47.800 --> 41:48.880
and see your wish fulfilled.

41:54.820 --> 41:57.300
(Yuan Jiarong, Lin Xiuru's stepdaughter,
First Young Lady of the Yuan family)

41:57.300 --> 41:59.050
(Yuan Jiawei, Second Young Lady
Yuan Jiaqin, Third Young Lady)

41:59.064 --> 42:00.340
(Yuan Jiaming, Fourth Young Lady)

42:03.760 --> 42:05.159
Here comes the dowry gift!

42:23.039 --> 42:23.719
Xiushu,

42:24.280 --> 42:25.599
here's my gift for your dowry.

42:26.400 --> 42:29.239
What treasure is inside?

42:29.760 --> 42:31.599
Why does this jar look

42:31.719 --> 42:34.039
like a cricket jar to me?

42:39.480 --> 42:42.119
The Lin family's Third Young Madam

42:42.199 --> 42:44.159
gave the Fourth Young Lady a cricket.

42:44.320 --> 42:45.440
Once word gets out,

42:45.639 --> 42:48.039
it'll be quite the tale in Jinling City.

42:51.920 --> 42:53.280
I told you to prepare a dowry gift,

42:53.480 --> 42:55.239
and you got me a cricket?

42:56.239 --> 42:57.079
What's going on?

42:58.000 --> 42:59.800
This is no ordinary cricket.

42:59.800 --> 43:01.000
It's a Matou King.

43:05.020 --> 43:07.540
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:09.039 --> 43:09.920
Xiuru.

43:10.639 --> 43:12.559
If you don't want Shaohui
to take a concubine,

43:13.239 --> 43:15.519
there's only one way now.

43:16.480 --> 43:17.559
What way?

43:19.360 --> 43:20.239
If Shaohui

43:20.239 --> 43:22.239
insists on doing as Old Madam Yuan says

43:22.559 --> 43:23.840
and taking Biwu as a concubine,

43:24.760 --> 43:25.880
then separate from him.

43:32.360 --> 43:33.199
I agree.

43:34.199 --> 43:34.880
No.

43:36.119 --> 43:36.840
No.

43:53.380 --> 43:57.500
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:00.340 --> 44:04.860
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:06.140 --> 44:10.060
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:10.740 --> 44:13.500
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:14.220 --> 44:16.540
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:16.540 --> 44:19.620
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:21.140 --> 44:25.380
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:28.300 --> 44:32.460
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:34.260 --> 44:37.820
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:37.820 --> 44:41.380
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:42.180 --> 44:47.860
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:48.220 --> 44:52.540
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:52.900 --> 44:55.860
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:55.860 --> 44:59.620
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

44:59.620 --> 45:02.500
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:02.500 --> 45:06.580
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:06.580 --> 45:09.940
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:09.940 --> 45:13.700
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:13.700 --> 45:17.700
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

